66,3,1,talk,Victoria,,"I agree. Although the financial unpredictability of separate bookings is not ideal, the city break is the most rational choice given the constraints of the other options. I vote for Option B.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,1,talk,Midori,,I'm happy we found a solution that balances our need for togetherness and personal space. It sounds like the most harmonious choice for us all. I vote for Option B.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,1,talk,Toshio,,The efficiency of the city's transport and the lack of travel waste make it the only logical choice. I vote for Option B.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I feel much better knowing I'll have my own space and no strict schedule. I'm glad we all agree. I vote for Option B.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
